# CLAUDE.local.md — personal overrides (NEVER committed)

Loaded by Claude Code after CLAUDE.md, per directory. Keep out of git (see gitignore.append).

Per-developer facts that must not go into the shared AGENTS.md: local test accounts, sandbox/staging URLs, personal machine paths, scratch env names.

